This repository contains the full Pi monorepo tree, grafted at v0.84.0 with
history, so that upstream releases can be merged with ordinary git merges.

Apex Code MODIFIES and redistributes these packages:

  packages/coding-agent   ->  apex-code
  packages/agent          ->  apex-code-agent-core

Apex Code redistributes these packages UNMODIFIED. They are frozen: CI asserts
each is byte-identical to the upstream tag recorded in docs/upstream-log.md, and
published Apex Code artifacts depend on the @earendil-works/* releases from npm
rather than on these in-tree copies.

  packages/ai        packages/protocol   packages/session-backends
  packages/tui       packages/server     packages/evals
  packages/client    packages/telemetry

The fork point and every subsequent upstream merge are recorded in
docs/upstream-log.md.
